\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Left.} Learned residual density after estimator initialization and after joint training, against the injected background-noise density (Burgers, $5\%$ gross outliers). Joint training resolves the asymmetric, multimodal noise. \textbf  {Right.} Trained gate against the standardized log-density on Allen--Cahn at $10\%$ gross outliers, with one in five measurements of each class plotted. The gate is nearly a hard decision and excludes $98\%$ of corrupted and $0.75\%$ of clean measurements. Labels are used only for this plot.}}{8}{figure.62}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:learned}{{3}{8}{\textbf {Left.} Learned residual density after estimator initialization and after joint training, against the injected background-noise density (Burgers, $5\%$ gross outliers). Joint training resolves the asymmetric, multimodal noise. \textbf {Right.} Trained gate against the standardized log-density on Allen--Cahn at $10\%$ gross outliers, with one in five measurements of each class plotted. The gate is nearly a hard decision and excludes $98\%$ of corrupted and $0.75\%$ of clean measurements. Labels are used only for this plot}{figure.62}{}}
